  "remarks": "JSC “Promsintez” is an enterprise of the military and industrial complex of the Russian Federation engaged in the production of explosives. The JSC “Promsintez” plant produces a wide range of explosives, including TNT, which is directly used in the production of ammunition. JSC “Promsintez” therefore forms part of Russia’s military and industrial complex.",
